49 CD GOV-017 ARC-020~ m=RA k=P st=S c=M rel=GOV-005 | Classes restate GOV-017; the five-question test reserves choices the oracle leaves open.
  t: classifying a consequential choice
  e: NONE
  x: in an unclear case, any yes to the five questions makes the choice Reserved, including removing a dependency
  s: A local, behavior-neutral removal of an unused dependency: GOV-005 and DEP-001 leave it open; L0's test reserves it.
50 CD GOV-005 GOV-017~ m=D k=P st=S c=M | Delegation is limited to choices changing no boundary, dependency, convention, contract or behavior.
  x: Delegated excludes any dependency, boundary or accepted-convention change
  s: A routine internal choice that adds a small utility dependency with no observable change: GOV-005 delegates it; L0 does not.
